# Octane cut list: what the low-end-PC version of the pack drops or changes.
#
# The `octane` branch is never edited by hand. mms-octane-build.sh rebuilds it
# from main on every prod deploy: it resets octane to main, applies this list,
# runs packwiz refresh, and force-pushes. Change Octane by editing this file on
# main, never by committing to the octane branch.
#
# Players opt in by pointing their Prism pre-launch command at
#   https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mudbourn/mms-pack/octane/pack.toml
#
# Only client-side mods belong here. Cutting anything the server also runs
# would stop Octane players joining.
#
# Line formats:
#   mod <slug>          remove mods/<slug>.pw.toml
#   pack <folder>       remove resourcepacks/<folder> and drop it from the
#                       resourcePacks line in both options files
#   option <key>:<val>  set an options.txt value (both options files)

# ── shaders and visuals ──
mod iris
mod lambdynamiclights
mod fallingleaves
mod particle-rain
mod particle-core
mod continuity
mod bettergrassify
mod skyboxify
mod animatica-continuation
mod polytone
mod cinematic-respawn
mod chatanimation

# ── ambient extras ──
mod ambientsounds
mod presence-footsteps
mod sound
mod cosy-critters

# ── memory ──
mod bobby

# ── resource packs ──
pack FreshAnimations_v1.10.4
pack FA+All_Extensions-v1.8.1
pack FA+Creepers-v2.1
pack FA+Details-v2.2.1
pack FA+Emissive-v1.6
pack FA+Objects-v2.1.2
pack FA+Spiders-v2.2
pack Freshly Modded 3.0.3
pack Fresh Patch - Variants and Ventures
pack DetailedAnimationsV0.19
pack Better-Leaves-9.5
pack toheee1234's Better Combat Animations
pack Semos Animations Lib 2.0.3
pack aerialhell-trident-3d
pack basicweapons-pike-3d
pack bountifulfish-anchor-3d
pack bountifulfish-tuna-3d

# ── lighter defaults ──
# options.txt is preserve=true, so these only reach new installs; existing
# players keep the settings they already have.
option renderDistance:8
option simulationDistance:6
option particles:2
